// Source: https://github.com/Shriya-Commits/Microsoft-Sentinel-Threat-Detection
// Collected: 2026-06-30
// KQL Library - https://github.com/sivolko/kql-library

SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4625
| summarize FailedAttempts = count() by Account, Computer, bin(TimeGenerated, 5m)
| where FailedAttempts >= 5
| sort by FailedAttempts desc